{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Bezalel son of Uri son of Hur.</b> Therefore it mentioned his father's father in connection with Bezalel, whereas regarding Aholiab it mentioned only his father — because Hur was killed on account of the incident of the calf, and the Tabernacle came to atone for the incident of the calf; therefore he is mentioned here in connection with the Tabernacle."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:22.540769928Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}